X:1
T:O Sacred Head, Now Wounded
T:PASSION CHORALE
C:Music: Hans Leo Hassler, 1601. Adapted by J.S. Bach, 1729 · Words: Bernard of Clairvaux, 1153. Translated by James W. Alexander, 1830
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: The Episcopal Hymnal, 1916, Hymn 158.. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/passion_chorale_hassler): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
